p":9183.317,"atk":378.707,"def":969.1065},{"level":77,"ascended":false,"hp":9255.9836,"atk":381.654,"def":976.7697},{"level":78,"ascended":false,"hp":9328.564,"atk":384.6045,"def":984.4329},{"level":79,"ascended":false,"hp":9401.2306,"atk":387.555,"def":992.0961},{"level":80,"ascended":false,"hp":9473.8972,"atk":390.5055,"def":999.7593},{"level":80,"ascended":true,"hp":10048.5926,"atk":408.0055,"def":1060.0326},{"level":81,"ascended":false,"hp":10121.173,"atk":410.9525,"def":1067.6958},{"level":82,"ascended":false,"hp":10193.8396,"atk":413.903,"def":1075.359},{"level":83,"ascended":false,"hp":10266.5062,"atk":416.8535,"def":1083.0222},{"level":84,"ascended":false,"hp":10339.0866,"atk":419.8005,"def":1090.6854},{"level":85,"ascended":false,"hp":10411.7532,"atk":422.751,"def":1098.3486},{"level":86,"ascended":false,"hp":10484.4198,"atk":425.7015,"def":1106.0118},{"level":87,"ascended":false,"hp":10557.0002,"atk":428.6485,"def":1113.675},{"level":88,"ascended":false,"hp":10629.6668,"atk":431.599,"def":1121.3382},{"level":89,"ascended":false,"hp":10702.3334,"atk":434.5495,"def":1129.0014},{"level":90,"ascended":false,"hp":10775,"atk":437.5,"def":1136.6646}],"baseCritRate":0.05,"baseCritDmg":1.5,"traceNodes":[{"id":859,"stat":"critRate","value":0.012,"label":"Crit. Rate increased by 1.20%."},{"id":860,"stat":"atkPct","value":0.018,"label":"ATK increased by 1.80%."},{"id":861,"stat":"atkPct","value":0.018,"label":"ATK increased by 1.80%."},{"id":862,"stat":"critRate","value":0.012,"label":"Crit. Rate increased by 1.20%."},{"id":863,"stat":"critRate","value":0.028,"label":"Crit. Rate increased by 2.80%."},{"id":864,"stat":"atkPct","value":0.042,"label":"ATK increased by 4.20%."},{"id":865,"stat":"atkPct","value":0.042,"label":"ATK increased by 4.20%."},{"id":866,"stat":"critRate","value":0.028,"label":"Crit. Rate increased by 2.80%."}],"skills":[{"id":1005101,"type":"normal","name":"One, Two, Three","description":"Basic Attack\n\nPerform up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing Aero DMG.\nEnter the Decipher state for 5s after casting Basic Attack Stage 4. This effect ends early if Sigrika is switched off the field.\nWhen Sigrika has at least 50 points of Full Stop, her Basic Attack cycle starts from Stage 2.\n\nBasic Attack - Elucidated\n\nWhile in the Decipher state, press Normal Attack on the ground to cast Basic Attack - Elucidated, dealing Aero DMG (considered Echo Skill DMG).\nLeave the Decipher state upon casting this skill.\n\nHeavy Attack\n\nConsume STA to attack the target, dealing Aero DMG.\nPress Normal Attack shortly after casting Heavy Attack to cast Basic Attack Stage 2.\n\nMid-air Attack\n\nConsume STA to perform Plunging Attack, dealing Aero DMG.\nPress Normal Attack shortly after casting Plunging Attack to cast Basic Attack Stage 2.\n\nDodge Counter\n\nPress Normal Attack shortly after a successful Dodge on the ground to attack the target, dealing Aero DMG.\nPress Normal Attack shortly after casting Dodge Counter to cast Basic Attack Stage 4.\n\nDodge Counter - Decipher\n\nWhile in the Decipher state, press Normal Attack shortly after a successful Dodge on the ground to cast Dodge Counter - Decipher to attack the target, dealing Aero DMG (considered Echo Skill DMG).\nLeave the Decipher state upon casting this skill.\n\nMid-air Dodge Counter\n\nPress Normal Attack shortly after a successful Dodge in mid-air to attack the target, dealing Aero DMG.\nPress Normal Attack shortly after casting Mid-air Dodge Counter to cast Basic Attack Stage 2.","actionIds":[1412001,1412002,1412003,1412004,1412005,1412006,1412007,1412008,1412028,1412030]},{"id":1005102,"type":"skill","name":"Royan Close Quarters Combat","description":"BOOMY BOOM!\n\nAttack the target, dealing Aero DMG.\nPress Normal Attack shortly after casting BOOMY BOOM! to cast Basic Attack Stage 3.\n\nBIG BOOMY BOOM!\n\nWhile in the Decipher state, press Resonance Skill on the ground to cast BIG BOOMY BOOM!, dealing Aero DMG (considered Echo Skill DMG).\nLeave the Decipher state upon casting this skill.\n\nSoliskin to the Aid\n\nWhile in the Decipher state, with at least 50 points of Full Stop, press Resonance Skill on the ground to cast Soliskin to the Aid, dealing Aero DMG (considered Echo Skill DMG).\nLeave the Decipher state upon casting this skill.","actionIds":[1412011,1412012,1412013]},{"id":1005103,"type":"liberation","name":"Where Trust Leads Me!","description":"Deal Aero DMG (considered Echo Skill DMG). Gain Divergent for 20s.\n\nDivergent\n\nThe next time Sigrika obtains a Rune, she additionally obtains a Rune of the opposite type and removes Divergent.\nWhen Sigrika holds Divergent and Convergent at the same time, Convergent takes priority.\nWhen Sigrika holds 100 points of Full Stop, Divergent doesn't take effect.","actionIds":[1412015]},{"id":1005104,"type":"inherent","name":"True Names Invoked","description":"Casting Intro Skill - Solsworn Etymology grants Convergent for 20s.\n\nConvergent\n\nThe next time Sigrika obtains a Rune, she additionally obtains a Rune of the same type and removes Convergent.\nWhen Sigrika holds Divergent and Convergent at the same time, Convergent takes priority.\nWhen Sigrika holds 100 points of Full Stop, Convergent doesn't take effect.","actionIds":[]},{"id":1005105,"type":"inherent","name":"True Names Aligned","description":"When any nearby Resonators in the team cast Echo Skill, Sigrika gains a stack of Blessing of Runes, up to 6 stacks. Echoes with the same name can only trigger this effect once.\nThis effect resets upon a lineup change.\n\nBlessing of Runes\n\nEach stack of Blessing of Runes grants the active Resonator in the team 3% Aero DMG Bonus and 3% Echo Skill DMG Bonus.\nWhen Blessing of Runes reaches 6 stacks, Sigrika additionally gains 30% Aero DMG Bonus and Echo Skill DMG Bonus.\n\nFor every 1% of Sigrika's Energy Regen over 125%, Sigrika gains 2% Echo Skill DMG Bonus for up to 50%.","actionIds":[]},{"id":1005106,"type":"intro","name":"Solsworn Etymology","description":"Deal Aero DMG.\nPress Normal Attack shortly after casting Intro Skill to cast Basic Attack Stage 2.","actionIds":[1412019]},{"id":1005107,"type":"forte","name":"Within Infinity's Embrace","description":"Heavy Attack - Schemata of Runes\n\nHold Normal Attack to consume two Runes and cast Heavy Attack - Schemata of Runes, dealing Aero DMG. Based on the types of the Runes consumed, Sigrika gains the following effects:\n- When consuming Rune: Trust and Rune: Answer, this skill gains the effect of Runic Outburst.\n- When consuming two Runes: Trust, this skill gains the effect of Runic Chain Whip.\n- When consuming two Runes: Answer, this skill gains the effect of Runic Soliskin.\nWhen consuming Runes, if Sigrika holds at least 30 points of Soliskin Vitality, consume 30 points to increase the DMG Multipliers of the current Runic Outburst, Runic Chain Whip, and Runic Soliskin by 50%. Obtain a stack of Innate Gift?.\nWhen consuming Runes, if Soliskin Vitality is lower than 30 points, consume all Soliskin Vitality. Every 10 points of Soliskin Vitality consumed grants the current Runic Outburst, Runic Chain Whip, and Runic Soliskin 15% DMG Amplification.\nHeavy Attack - Schemata of Runes deals Echo Skill DMG.\n\nRunic Outburst\n\nDeal Aero DMG (considered Echo Skill DMG).\n\nRunic Chain Whip\n\nStagnate nearby targets and deal Aero DMG (considered Echo Skill DMG).\n\nRunic Soliskin\n\nPull in nearby targets and deal Aero DMG (considered Echo Skill DMG).\n\nForte Circuit - Learn My True Name\n\nWhen Full Stop reaches 100 points, if Forte Circuit - Learn My True Name is not on Cooldown, press Resonance Skill to cast Resonance Skill - BOOMY BOOM! or Resonance Skill - Soliskin to the Aid. Hold Resonance Skill to consume all Full Stop to cast Forte Circuit - Learn My True Name, dealing Aero DMG (considered Echo Skill DMG).\n\nInnate Gift?\n\nSigrika can hold up to 2 stacks of Innate Gift?. Each stack grants Runic Outburst, Runic Chain Whip, Runic Soliskin and Forte Circuit - Learn My True Name 30% DMG Amplification.\nThis effect ends after Sigrika casts Forte Circuit - Learn My True Name or is switched off the field.\n\nRune\n\nSigrika holds up to 4 Runes. Without Full Stop, Sigrika can only hold up to 2 {Cus:Sap,S=Rune P=Runes SapTag=A}. When Sigrika gains a new Rune at max capacity, the existing Runes shift one slot to the left, removing the leftmost Rune. With at least 50 {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=B} of Full Stop, Sigrika can hold 2 additional {Cus:Sap,S=Rune P=Runes SapTag=C}.\nHitting a target directly with Basic Attack - Elucidated or Dodge Counter - Decipher in the duration of the moves grants one Rune: Trust.\nHitting a target directly with Resonance Skill - BIG BOOMY BOOM! or Resonance Skill - Soliskin to the Aid in the duration of the moves grants one Rune: Answer.\n\nFull Stop\n\nAfter casting Heavy Attack - Schemata of Runes, gain 50 {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=D} of Full Stop, up to 100 points.\n\nSoliskin Vitality\n\nWhen any nearby Resonators in the team cast Echo Skill, Sigrika gains 10 {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=E} of Soliskin Vitality, up to 60 {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=F}. Echoes with the same name can only trigger this effect once. Casting Outro Skill - In This Very Moment resets the record of Echo triggering this effect.","actionIds":[1412021,1412022,1412023,1412024,1412025]},{"id":1005108,"type":"inherent","name":"","description":"Has a chance to produce special dishes when cooking.","actionIds":[]},{"id":1005109,"type":"outro","name":"In This Very Moment","description":"Attack the target, deal Aero DMG equal to 795% of Sigrika's ATK. Gain 2 stacks of Encapsulated for 30s.\n\nEncapsulated\n\nWhen any nearby Resonators in the team cast Echo Skills, Stagnate the target and consume 1 stacks of Encapsulated. Encapsulated stacks up to 2 times.\nAll stacks of Encapsulated are removed when Sigrika is removed from the lineup.","actionIds":[]},{"id":1005110,"type":"tuneBreak","name":"Tune Break: Gauntlets","d